  'Permission Preset 只是把沙箱模式与审批策略这两个独立强制旋钮包装成一个客户端选项。预设自身不执行隔离，也不替代审批；切换时仍通过各自服务的规范 setter 写入日志。': 'A permission preset only wraps the two independent enforcement knobs—sandbox mode and approval policy—into one client option. The preset enforces no isolation and replaces no approval; switching still writes through each service’s canonical setter.',
