  '，而不是递归合并其中的字段。': ' value on the target row instead of recursively merging its fields.',
  '连接外部能力': 'Connect external capabilities',
  '连接 MCP Server': 'Connect an MCP server',
  'MCP Client 插件把外部服务器的工具注册到 ': 'The MCP client plugin registers tools from an external server with ',
  '。每个服务器使用一个插件实例，支持本地 ': '. Use one plugin instance per server. Both local ',
  ' 与远程 ': ' and remote ',
  ' 两种传输。': ' transports are supported.',
  '公开名称是 ': 'The public name is a deterministic function of ',
  ' 的确定性函数，因此重连和重新同步不会改名。服务器崩溃后默认指数退避重连；正常工具世代在恢复期间保持注册，但调用会暂时失败。': ', so reconnecting and resynchronizing never rename a tool. After a server crash, reconnection uses exponential backoff by default. The last healthy generation stays registered during recovery, though calls fail temporarily.',
  '当前范围': 'Current scope',
  '目前只桥接 MCP Tools。Resources 与 Prompts 尚无 Harness 消费接口；非文本结果在模型上下文中会变成占位符，但完整 JSON 块仍保留在执行局部的规范值中。': 'Only MCP tools are bridged today. Harness has no consumer interface for resources or prompts yet. Non-text results become placeholders in model context, while complete JSON blocks remain available in the execution-local canonical value.',
  'Skills 的发现与加载': 'Skill discovery and loading',
  'Skill 是可复用的 Agent 指令。提供方负责发现候选项，注册表合并全局层与当前 scope，': 'A skill is a reusable set of agent instructions. Providers discover candidates, the registry merges the global layer with the current scope, and ',
  ' 再向模型公开目录和按需加载工具。': ' exposes a catalog and an on-demand loader to the model.',
  '发现摘要': 'Discover summaries',
  '按 scope 合并': 'Merge by scope',
  '只展示名称与描述': 'Show names and descriptions',
  '按需读取正文': 'Load content on demand',
  '目录与正文采用渐进式加载，避免把所有 Skill 内容塞进每次请求。每个 Skill 都声明 ': 'Catalog and content use progressive loading so every request does not include every skill. Each skill declares ',
  ' 与 ': ' and ',
  '，模型入口和用户入口必须分别检查自己的调用策略。': '; model and user entry points must each check their applicable invocation policy.',
  'Plan Mode 是按 Agent 记录在会话日志中的协作状态。': 'Plan mode is per-agent collaboration state recorded in the session log. ',
  ' 进入，': ' enters it, ',
  ' 直接退出；模型调用 ': ' exits directly, and a model call to ',
  ' 时必须经过用户明确评审。': ' requires explicit user review.',
  '写入或排队 ': 'Commit or queue ',
  '注入部署方配置的 Plan 指引': 'Inject deployment-configured plan guidance',
  '用户批准后提交退出状态': 'Commit the exit after user approval',
  '软引导，不是安全边界': 'Guidance, not a security boundary',
  'Plan Mode 只改变模型指引与评审流程，不会强制沙箱或批准策略。需要限制写入和命令时，应单独配置权限控制。': 'Plan mode changes model guidance and review flow only. It does not enforce sandbox or approval policy. Configure permission controls separately when writes and commands must be restricted.',
  'Web 搜索与抓取': 'Web search and fetch',
  'Web capability seam 将模型工具与具体提供方分离。': 'The web capability seam separates model tools from concrete providers. ',
  ' 用于发现来源，': ' discovers sources, while ',
  ' 获取指定 URL，并把 HTML 转换为 Markdown。': ' retrieves a specific URL and converts HTML to Markdown.',
  '接收 query，返回可选答案、来源标题、URL、摘要与发布时间。': 'Takes a query and returns an optional answer, source titles, URLs, snippets, and publication dates.',
  '默认最多 8 个来源': 'Up to 8 sources by default',
