  '后台任务': 'Background jobs',
  '图片进入会话前会先被校验并持久化，再以不可变引用写入消息。会话日志只保存内容寻址的 attachment id、媒体类型、字节数和固有尺寸，不保存浏览器对象 URL、宿主临时路径、提供方 URL 或 base64 正文。': 'Before an image enters a session, it is validated and persisted, then written into the message as an immutable reference. The session log stores only a content-addressed attachment ID, media type, byte length, and intrinsic dimensions—never browser object URLs, host temporary paths, provider URLs, or base64 payloads.',
  '验证全部图片': 'Validate every image',
  '检查真实媒体签名、解码结果、尺寸、单图与整批限制。': 'Check the actual media signature, decoded image, dimensions, per-image limit, and batch limit.',
  '原子持久化': 'Persist atomically',
  '只有整批通过准入检查后才保存，拒绝不会留下部分对象。': 'Save only after the whole batch passes admission, so rejection leaves no partial objects.',
  '追加会话事件': 'Append the session event',
  '模型与历史记录拿到耐久引用，读取时再次校验摘要与元数据。': 'The model and history receive a durable reference whose digest and metadata are verified again on read.',
  '版本一只接受 PNG、JPEG、WebP 和 GIF 栅格图片。': 'Version one accepts PNG, JPEG, WebP, and GIF raster images only. ',
  ' 是不透明标识；调用方不得解析它或据此拼接文件路径。': ' is opaque; callers must not parse it or derive a filesystem path from it.',
  '当 Agent 缺少会实质改变结果的信息时，可以通过结构化问题暂停并等待人类回答。每个问题带稳定 id，可提供单选、多选、自由文本和补充说明；回答仍按 id 返回，避免批量提问时依赖位置。': 'When an agent lacks information that would materially change the result, it can pause with a structured question and wait for a human answer. Each question has a stable ID and may offer single choice, multiple choice, free text, and supporting detail; answers return by ID so batches never depend on position.',
  '普通选择': 'Standard choice',
  '选项标签同时是 UI 文案和返回给模型的稳定值；说明文字只用于帮助决策。': 'An option label is both UI copy and the stable value returned to the model; its description only helps the decision.',
  '意图只改变 UI 呈现，不改变回答协议；批准项由标签明确指定，不能靠选项顺序猜测。': 'Intent changes presentation, not the answer protocol. The approving option is named explicitly instead of inferred from order.',
  '自由输入': 'Free-form input',
  '单选时“其他”会覆盖已选项；多选时可以同时保留选项与补充文本。': 'For single-select, Other replaces the selected option; for multi-select, choices and supplementary text may coexist.',
  '只能由运行时根提问': 'Only a runtime root can ask',
  '受父 Agent 管理的 Subagent 没有独立的人类应答者，因此不能发起交互请求；取消、没有 UI provider 或调用方已失活都会返回结构化错误，而不是无限等待。': 'A subagent owned by a parent has no independent human answerer and cannot initiate interaction. Cancellation, a missing UI provider, or a stale caller returns a structured error instead of waiting forever.',
  '长时间运行的 Bash 与 Subagent 共用后台任务运行时。启动后会立即得到形如 ': 'Long-running Bash processes and subagents share the background-job runtime. Starting one immediately returns a job ID such as ',
  ' 的 job id，再通过统一接口查看状态、增量读取输出、等待完成或请求终止。': ', after which a unified interface can inspect status, read incremental output, wait for completion, or request termination.',
  '生产方持有执行资源，任务可读取新输出。': 'The producer owns execution resources and new output can be read.',
  '终止请求已发出，等待生产方释放资源。': 'Termination was requested; the runtime is waiting for the producer to release resources.',
  '终态不可逆，并记录结束时间与详细原因。': 'The terminal state is irreversible and records finish time and detail.',
  '输出读取使用单一消费游标：流式任务每次返回上次读取后的增量，只有最终输出的任务则在结束后重复返回同一结果。任务访问按拥有者 session 授权；Agent 被释放时，其任务会被取消并等待清理完成。': 'Output uses a single consuming cursor: streaming jobs return the delta since the prior read, while final-output-only jobs return the same result repeatedly after completion. Access is authorized by the owner session; disposing the agent cancels its jobs and waits for cleanup.',
  '取消不是瞬间完成': 'Cancellation is not instant completion',
  ' 只请求生产方终止并把状态推进到 ': ' only asks the producer to stop and advances the status to ',
  '。只有生产方真正释放资源、': '. Only after the producer releases its resources and ',
  ' settle 后，任务才进入 ': ' settles does the job enter ',
