  '浏览器会话搜索': 'Browser session search',
  'Shell 与持久 Terminal': 'Shell and persistent terminals',
  '两者都能运行命令，但生命周期不同。默认使用 Shell 完成有边界的一次性操作；只有任务需要交互式 stdin、REPL、开发服务器或持续终端状态时，才打开 PTY Terminal。': 'Both run commands, but their lifecycles differ. Use Shell by default for bounded one-shot operations; open a PTY terminal only when work needs interactive stdin, a REPL, a development server, or persistent terminal state.',
  '等待命令结束，分别报告退出码、信号、超时与调用方取消；非零退出是正常结果，不是基础设施异常。': 'Waits for completion and reports exit code, signal, timeout, and caller cancellation independently. A nonzero exit is a normal result, not an infrastructure error.',
  '立即转成通用 job；没有执行器超时，通过增量游标读取输出，并可请求终止整个进程组。': 'Immediately becomes a generic job with no executor timeout. Output is consumed through an incremental cursor, and the whole process group can be asked to stop.',
  '保留 shell 状态和 scrollback，支持发送输入、分页读取、信号、列出与显式关闭。': 'Preserves shell state and scrollback, with input, paged reads, signals, listing, and explicit close.',
