  'Harness 会清除子进程环境中的凭据及继承的 ': 'Harness removes credentials and inherited ',
  ' 名称，再合并本次受管环境快照。输出超过内存预算时只内联尾部，并用私有 spill 文件保留完整流的恢复信息。': ' names from the subprocess environment before merging the current managed snapshot. When output exceeds the memory budget, only the tail stays inline and a private spill file retains recovery information for the full stream.',
  'LSP 精确代码导航': 'Precise LSP code navigation',
  '文本搜索适合普通浏览；当同名符号含义不清，或修改前必须确认精确定义、实现和引用时，使用只读 ': 'Text search is best for ordinary browsing. When same-named symbols are ambiguous, or a change requires exact definitions, implementations, and references, use the read-only ',
  ' 工具。它只公开四种闭合操作：': ' tool. It exposes exactly four closed operations:',
