  ' 来自 worker 报告，没有独立评估器。普通 child 失败会终止运行而不会自动重试；取消后局部输出也不会伪装成成功。': ' comes from a worker report with no independent evaluator. A normal child failure terminates the run without automatic retry, and partial output after cancellation is never presented as success.',
